  "question": {
    "text": "A planet moves around the sun (mass =&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub></math>) in an elliptical orbit such that its minimum and maximum distance from the sun are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> respectively. The period of revolution of this planet around the sun is",
